|- id="City Hall"
|[[File:City Hall.png|180px]]
[[Jinzhou City Hall]]
|Located in the highest position in Jinzhou, the City Hall stands as the paramount political hub, housing the vital data repository — the Grand Library. Since the establishment of Jinzhou, it has served as the residence of every Jinzhou Magistrate. The current Magistrate of Jinzhou is Jinhsi.
|- id="Jinzhou Huaxu Academy"
|[[File:Huaxu Academy.png|180px]]
[[Jinzhou Huaxu Academy]]
|Huaxu Academy is a collective of researchers dedicated to inventing new ways to aid the prosperity of Huanglong, as well as uncovering the mysteries of the world. Focused on discerning the truth from remnants of ancient knowledge, echoes of the world, and the enigmatic frozen tundra, the researchers at Huaxu Academy delve into the depths of understanding.
|- id="Pioneer Association"
| [[File:Pioneer Association Jinzhou.png|180px]]
[[Jinzhou Pioneer Association]]
|The Pioneer Association, founded before the Lament, is a prestigious organization in science and education.

The Pioneer Association continues to collaborate with scientists, photographers, and journalists to explore and document the world's wonders after the Ebb Tide.

Their hard work leads to groundbreaking discoveries that captivate global audiences through mediums like magazines, maps, books, entertainment, and interactive media.
|}

